, prices, stock, and images.
+4. Test registration and password recovery.
+5. Test the cart from desktop and mobile navigation.
+6. Test checkout, cancellation, failure, duplicate callback, amount mismatch, refund, and reconciliation.
+7. Confirm order email delivery.
+8. Test keyboard navigation, 200% zoom, contrast, and reduced motion.
+9. Run the full repository checks and a low-value live transaction.
+
+The Docker production example is a baseline, not a substitute for professional operations and legal/security review.
diff --git a/plugin/barbershop-core/assets/admin.js b/plugin/barbershop-core/assets/admin.js
